    "title": "Fire at South Park Golf Course Clubhouse",
    "text": "Trending Story\nUpdated 03:22 AM UTC, Thu July 24, 2025\nFire at South Park Golf Course Clubhouse\nBUFFALO, N.Y. — The Buffalo Fire Department responded to a structure fire at the South Park Golf Course Clubhouse on South Park Avenue, shortly after 11 p.m. Tuesday. Officials say the fire caused significant damage, with around $250k in structural damage and $125,000 to the contents inside. Erie County...\nMark Poloncarz\n\"This is a place that's near and dear to me. I've been president of the South Park Golf Club, had many roles played here yesterday, and it was, it was very sad because this place has a lot of meaning.\"\nSouth Park Golf Club\n\"While the building is not a total loss, it will in all likelihood be closed for the year.\"",
